    {
      "text": "Cain rose up against Abel … and slew him, Gen. 4:8 (Moses 5:32). Whoso sheddeth man’s blood, by man shall his blood be shed, Gen. 9:6. Thou shalt not kill, Ex. 20:13 (Deut. 5:17; Matt. 5:21; Mark 10:19; Mosiah 13:21; D&C 59:6). He that smiteth a man … shall be surely put to death, Ex. 21:12. he that killeth any man shall surely be put to death, Lev. 24:17. murderer shall be put to death by the mouth of witnesses, Num. 35:30. Will ye steal, murder, and commit adultery, Jer. 7:9. company of priests murder in the way by consent, Hosea 6:9.",
