      "text": "out of the heart proceed evil thoughts, murders, Matt. 15:19. Jesus said, Thou shalt do no murder, Matt. 19:18. who had committed murder in the insurrection, Mark 15:7. Who … for murder, was cast into prison, Luke 23:19. He was a murderer from the beginning, John 8:44. desired a murderer to be granted unto you, Acts 3:14. whom ye have been now the betrayers and murderers, Acts 7:52. No doubt this man is a murderer, Acts 28:4. maliciousness; full of envy, murder, Rom. 1:29. murders … they which do such things shall not inherit the kingdom, Gal. 5:21. law is not made for a righteous man, but for … murderers of fathers and murderers of mothers, 1 Tim. 1:9. let none of you suffer as a murderer, 1 Pet. 4:15. hateth his brother is a murderer … no murderer hath eternal life, 1 Jn. 3:15. Neither repented they of their murders, Rev. 9:21. murderers … shall have their part in the lake, Rev. 21:8. without are … murderers, Rev. 22:15.",
